    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d336">

                <pb facs="0365" n="249" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg249"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1490.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <lb/>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 25, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Conference yesterday and today with Bordas and his Minister. Have obtained full
                    acceptance of President Wilson’s plan. Proclamation of resignation by Bordas
                    being prepared to be issued to Dominican people on our order. Expect to settle
                    on name of Provisional President tomorrow and if possible induct him into office
                    by Thursday at three o’clock.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fort</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
